    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d510">

                <pb facs="0463" n="389" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg389"/>

                <head>Mr. Hunter to Mr. Pike</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-04-21"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 21, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Your despatch of the 5th instant, No. 161,
                    concerning public opinion in Europe as to the result of our civil war, and
                    enclosing an interesting item from Galignani relative to the rebel ram
                    Stonewall, has been received.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. HUNTER, <hi rendition="#italic">Acting
                    Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">James</hi> S. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Pike,</hi> Esq., <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c.,
                        &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
